  "abstract": "In this short note, we prove the existence of in\ufb01nitely many pairwise non-isomorphic, non-hyperelliptic Riemann surfaces with automorp hism group act- ing transitively on the Weierstrass points. We also \ufb01nd all compact Rie mann sur- faces with automorphism group acting transitively on the Weierstra ss points, under the assumption that they are simple.",
